  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's MOLLE Modular Ambidextrous Holster is the epitome of versatility and functionality. Designed to accommodate both right and left-handed draws, this holster features an elastic cord with cinch webbing, ensuring reliable firearm security in any situation. Its ambidextrous design makes it suitable for a wide range of users, providing flexibility and convenience.</p>",
